        "product_summary": "Mid-top winter profile: Wavy stitched panels and a sculpted black sole give this lace-up style a layered casual look.\nPlush collar trim: Black pile is visible along the ankle opening, with pull loops at the tongue and heel.\nCross-lace closure: Round lower eyelets guide the laces across the tongue, below the shaped upper lace panel.\nPatterned outsole: The actual underside combines oval contact sections with triangular perimeter blocks.\nWholesale colour-size choices: Black and Black Yellow are offered in EU 39–48 for winter assortments.",
        "company_summary": "Quanzhou Beiqiang Footwear & Apparel Co., Ltd. is a footwear manufacturer based in Quanzhou, Fujian, China. We work with importers, wholesalers, brand owners and e-commerce businesses on wholesale and OEM/ODM footwear projects. From selecting existing styles to developing a design brief, reviewing samples and planning packaging, we help buyers turn their requirements into a clear order plan. Share your product direction and purchasing needs to discuss a suitable cooperation proposal."
